    "body": "### Changes in v1.2.7:\r\n\r\n- **Character Selection Retention**: Fixed an issue where returning to the character select screen reset Player 1 back to Sonic (Index 0). Unlocked and previously chosen characters (e.g. Knuckles) now remain selected across races.\r\n- **Single-Player Authentic Behavior**: Completely restricted lap validation checks to active online multiplayer (`g_netSessionActive`). Single-player modes (Grand Prix, Time Attack, Boss Duels such as the Tails Doll unlock race on Radical City, and Split-Screen) now run with 100% authentic 1997 game logic.\r\n- **Netplay Lap Validation Tuning**: Widened checkpoint detection ranges in multiplayer to ensure legitimate cuts and river shortcuts (e.g. Radical City start shortcut) register cleanly while still protecting public rooms from fraudulent lap skips.\r\n- **Multiplayer State Sync**: Applied stability improvements to character slot states to prevent hybrid animation and character mismatch glitches.\r\n",
