    "body": "### What's Changed in v1.2.6\n- **Anti-Cheat Lap & Checkpoint Validation**: Added strict sequential multi-checkpoint tracking and an 8.0-second minimum lap time threshold, eliminating start-line lap skipping exploits. Bogus lap claims are automatically rejected without desyncing.\n- **Split-Screen Rendering Fixed**: Resolved the viewport and letterbox aspect ratio glitch in 2-player local split-screen mode.\n- **Launcher UI**: Updated footer label to v1.2.6.",
