    "body": "### What's Changed in v1.2.5\n- **Full Balloon Mode Support in Netplay**: Enabled multiplayer Balloon Mode with synchronized item spawning, proper lobby submode mapping, and 5-balloon collection victory conditions.\n- **Podium Results Inversion Fix**: Corrected signed integer overflow in track progress calculations and disabled legacy camera packet writes, ensuring 1st place racers always stand atop the podium.\n- **Complete Ability & Character Synchronization**: Unified model IDs, animation tables, and physics abilities across all peers, preventing hybrid move-set glitches (e.g. Sonic flying with Tails' aura).\n- **3+ Player Room Stability**: Allocated dynamic ephemeral loopback ports on the host sidecar, resolving UDP address collisions and enabling seamless 3- and 4-player multiplayer sessions.\n- **UI Polish**: Updated launcher footer version label to reflect v1.2.5.",
