    "body": "### What's Changed in v1.2.4\r\n- **Full Character Selection Sync**: Fixed packet ordering and included character IDs in JOIN_REQ and SLOT_ASSIGN, completely resolving hybrid move-set glitches and wrong sprite states.\r\n- **Mid-Race Stability**: Prevented false returns to lobby during active races and hardened connection watchdogs to 60 seconds.\r\n- **Expanded Packet Buffer**: Increased network ring buffer to 256 packets to eliminate micro-stutter packet drops over mobile VPNs.\r\n- **Host Race Continuity**: Host sessions no longer auto-terminate if a remote player disconnects.\r\n- **Audio Fixes**: Resolved the infinite looping SFX bug on Client/Player 2.\r\n- **Keep Screen Awake**: Added FLAG_KEEP_SCREEN_ON to prevent device sleep and Wi-Fi throttling during races.\r\n- **Expanded Gamepad Support**: Added community SDL2 mappings for GameSir controllers (X2, G4 Pro, T4, etc.).",
