    "body": "### Changes in v1.2.3\n- **Prevent Mid-Game Disconnects**: Increased network silence timeout from 5s to 15s in host and client watchdogs to handle cellular / VPN packet latency without dropping connections.\n- **Fix Client Camera Divergence**: Guarded smoothing divisors against non-positive values (divisor <= 0 -> divisor = 1) in BuildCameraView to prevent coordinate explosion and black screen center-dot bugs.\n- **Multiplayer Camera Initialization**: Initialized all 4 player camera slots in InitRaceStart and ensured fovDetail = 0x20 in BuildChaseCamera."
